          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": " Here is the seed kit appeal, with two versions to review."
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "The utm_content value ends in -v0 for V0 and -v1 for V1."
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Only in V0: 'DONATE NOW'. Only in V1: 'HELP NOW'. Each label appears twice, once under the closing heading and once in the org row."
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Donate destinations: regular donors to give-regular and major donors to give-major."
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
